From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 14:02:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ci: add the release workflow (npm trusted publishing)

Publishes vX.Y.Z tags to npm with npm trusted publishing (GitHub OIDC)
and build provenance through the reusable workflow in senecajs/admin.
No npm token is stored. A manual run (workflow_dispatch) performs a dry
run that validates, builds and tests without publishing. The npm
trusted publisher must name this file (release.yml) and the `npm`
environment. See docs/create-a-release.md.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LaHppcejXbSsAH4BZXNsjV
---
 .github/workflows/release.yml | 56 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 56 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 .github/workflows/release.yml

diff --git a/.github/workflows/release.yml b/.github/workflows/release.yml
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..fde1dfa
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.github/workflows/release.yml
@@ -0,0 +1,56 @@
+# Publish a tagged release to npm using npm trusted publishing (GitHub OIDC).
+#
+# No npm token is stored anywhere: the workflow exchanges a short-lived GitHub
+# OIDC token for a publish credential, and npm attaches build provenance.
+#
+# Trigger: push a tag of the form vX.Y.Z (see docs/create-a-release.md), or
+# run manually (workflow_dispatch) for a dry run that validates and builds
+# without publishing.
+#
+# The npm trusted publisher for the `seneca` package must be configured as:
+#   Organization or user: senecajs
+#   Repository:           seneca
+#   Workflow filename:    release.yml   (this file - npm checks the *calling* workflow)
+#   Environment name:     npm
+#
+# The shared validation and publishing steps live in senecajs/admin.
+
+name: release
+
+on:
+  push:
+    tags:
+      - 'v*'
+  workflow_dispatch:
+    inputs:
+      dry-run:
+        description: 'Validate, build and test only (no publish, no GitHub release)'
+        type: boolean
+        default: true
+      tag:
+        description: 'Existing tag to release (vX.Y.Z). Leave empty for a dry run of the selected ref.'
+        type: string
+        default: ''
+      dist-tag:
+        description: 'npm dist-tag (default: latest, or next for prereleases; use e.g. 3x for maintenance releases)'
+        type: string
+        default: ''
+
+# One release at a time per ref; never cancel a publish in progress.
+concurrency:
+  group: release-${{ github.ref }}
+  cancel-in-progress: false
+
+permissions:
+  contents: write # create the GitHub release
+  id-token: write # mint the OIDC token for npm trusted publishing
+
+jobs:
+  release:
+    uses: senecajs/admin/.github/workflows/npm-release.yml@main
+    with:
+      node-version: '24'
+      tag: ${{ github.event_name == 'push' && github.ref_name || inputs.tag }}
+      dist-tag: ${{ inputs.dist-tag || '' }}
+      dry-run: ${{ github.event_name == 'workflow_dispatch' && inputs.dry-run || false }}
+      environment: npm
